                VIM Super League is a competitive Roblox football league built around fair play, clear structure, and a community that actually shows up — managers, players, and staff.
            </p>
            <p>
                From the player market to matchday fixtures, everything on this site is designed to make the season easier to follow and more exciting to play.
            </p>
            <div class="pc-about-quote">
                “We care about the details so matchday feels like it matters.”
                <cite>— VIM Super League</cite>
            </div>
